         <abstract>
            <p>A chronicle of the <ref type="ins" corresp="INS0341DL">Dabra Libānos</ref> monastery written in <date notBefore="1653" notAfter="1654">1653/1654</date>. Thus far it is known only from
               <ref type="mss" corresp="BNFabb108"/>, which was used for the partial Russian translation by Boris Turaev (see <bibl><ptr target="bm:Turaev1906ZenaDabralibanos"/></bibl>). Its edition remains a desideratum.
            </p>
